🔗 Promise Chaining (Callback Hell Ka Khatma)
Yaad hai pichli baar humne nested callbacks ka narak dekha tha? Promises use aise seedhe raste par le aata hai:

JavaScript
// Isko bolte hain Promise Chaining
checkUser(userId)
  .then(user => checkStock(user.cart))      // Ek ke baad ek .then jodte jao
  .then(stock => processPayment(stock))
  .then(payment => sendEmail(payment))
  .catch(err => console.log("Poore process mein kahin bhi error aayi toh main sambhal lunga!", err));
Ab code nesting ke bajaye upar se niche ek clean line mein padha jaa sakta hai.
